# ZMPINT - scales ʟMPP to whole-number coefficients with no common
# factor and a positive leading coefficient.  Uses I,Y,Z.
1→Y
While max(abs(fPart(round(YʟMPP,6))))>0 and Y<1000
  Y+1→Y
End
round(YʟMPP,6)→ʟMPP
0→Z
For(I,1,dim(ʟMPP))
  gcd(Z,abs(ʟMPP(I)))→Z
End
If ʟMPP(1)<0
⁻Z→Z
If Z≠0
ʟMPP/Z→ʟMPP
